# ---- the BLOCK gate (BH-762, optional — ON is the default) ----
# Every automatic merge path (bin/merge-conductor.sh, bin/merge-sweep.sh,
# bin/merge-queue.sh, bin/run-build.sh's tier-1 gate, bin/review-prs.sh) reads
# the PR conversation, the PR's review bodies and — on an Issues-board project —
# the ticket thread immediately before merging, and refuses on a BLOCK newer
# than the head with no later clearing comment from the same author.
# docs/MERGE-CONDUCTOR.md section 17 is the contract.
# 0 = warn only: the lane logs the block it found, with the comment's URL, and
# merges as it did before the gate. It is a rollback switch, not a tuning knob.
#BLOCK_GATE_ENFORCE=0

